  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "2100800",
      "subQuestName": "任务的开启$UNRELEASED$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210080000"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210080000": {
            "id": "210080000",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "火把怎么又熄灭了…$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080001"
            ]
          },
          "210080001": {
            "id": "210080001",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "火把怎么了？$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080002"
            ]
          },
          "210080002": {
            "id": "210080002",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "哦，是旅行者啊…你往前看，是不是能看见三座瞭望台？那上面本来应该燃着火把…$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080003"
            ]
          },
          "210080003": {
            "id": "210080003",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "归离原的道路都很不好走，而且还有很多怪物躲藏。火把一方面是为行人们照亮道路，另一方面，燃起火把也是表示没有怪物的威胁。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080004"
            ]
          },
          "210080004": {
            "id": "210080004",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "但是…我忙着去周围清除怪物，偏偏忘了给火把续上火，等我发现的时候，已经全都熄灭了。$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100801",
      "subQuestName": "第二次对话$UNRELEASED$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210080201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210080201": {
            "id": "210080201",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "交给我吧。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080202"
            ]
          },
          "210080202": {
            "id": "210080202",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "那就拜托你了！$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080203"
            ]
          },
          "210080203": {
            "id": "210080203",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "这条路上有三座嘹望塔，每座塔上分别有一个火盆。把它们都点燃以后，回来跟我说一声就行了。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080204"
            ]
          },
          "210080204": {
            "id": "210080204",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "在道路的尽头，有一座「七天神像」。你或许可以顺道供奉一下，那可是岩王爷的护佑啊。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080205"
            ]
          },
          "210080205": {
            "id": "210080205",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "无论怎样……这件事就拜托你了，顺路的时候记得过去看看，别忘了哦。$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100802",
      "subQuestName": "点燃平原瞭望塔上的火把$UNRELEASED$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
