      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100803",
      "subQuestName": "点燃火把$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210080301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210080301": {
            "id": "210080301",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "旅行者，快去点燃火把…抽查的人就要来了！$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100804",
      "subQuestName": "点燃火把$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210080401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210080401": {
            "id": "210080401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "归离原的道路？$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080402"
            ]
          },
          "210080402": {
            "id": "210080402",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "归璃原是岩层平原，所以有些地方山路崎岖，比如西边的瞭望坡。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080403"
            ]
          },
          "210080403": {
            "id": "210080403",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "但是东边靠海口的位置却很平坦，有空去瑶光滩看看也不错呢。$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100805",
      "subQuestName": "点燃火把$UNRELEASED",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "210080501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "210080501": {
            "id": "210080501",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "你的同伴呢？$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080502"
            ]
          },
          "210080502": {
            "id": "210080502",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "事情是这样的。同伴负责给火盆加燃料，我负责点火。$UNRELEASED",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "210080503"
            ]
          },
          "210080503": {
            "id": "210080503",
            "speakerId": 2428,
            "speakerName": "星火",
            "text": "虽然听起来很琐碎，但明确的分工是最重要的！$UNRELEASED"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2100806",
